{"unit_id":"FelixJiashengFu__token-stats#feature-1","repo":"FelixJiashengFu/token-stats","commit":"301e392bdf82291f7e9e35f2be5cc07dcee77f3d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Token Stats 的功能「会话用量汇总」：从 Harness 会话日志归集输入、输出、缓存和推理 Token，并按会话、模型、日期汇总。打开统计面板即可查看排行和趋势。","source":"generated","evidence":["stats-core.js:17-33","stats-core.js:185-225","stats-core.js:285-361"]}
{"unit_id":"FelixJiashengFu__token-stats#feature-2","repo":"FelixJiashengFu/token-stats","commit":"301e392bdf82291f7e9e35f2be5cc07dcee77f3d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Token Stats 的功能「成本与预算」：根据内置模型价格规则估算请求成本，也可在界面设置自定义单价和月度预算，用于查看预算进度。未匹配价格的模型会列为未计价。","source":"generated","evidence":["stats-pricing.js:72-125","stats-pricing.js:176-194","client.js:121-144"]}
{"unit_id":"FelixJiashengFu__token-stats#feature-3","repo":"FelixJiashengFu/token-stats","commit":"301e392bdf82291f7e9e35f2be5cc07dcee77f3d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Token Stats 的功能「资源状态面板」：在侧边栏和完整面板查看 Harness 进程及系统 CPU、内存和负载；macOS 上还会尝试读取 GPU 使用指标。数据随统计面板刷新展示。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:34-89","index.js:103-154","client.js:911-998"]}
{"unit_id":"FelixJiashengFu__token-stats#caveat-1","repo":"FelixJiashengFu/token-stats","commit":"301e392bdf82291f7e9e35f2be5cc07dcee77f3d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Token Stats 使用内置价格表估算费用，无法代表服务商账单；预算和自定义单价保存在浏览器 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["stats-pricing.js:64-69","client.js:121-144"]}
